WEBVTT

00:07:30.556 --> 00:07:34.156
Today, we have more than 30 such sites,

00:07:34.596 --> 00:07:37.716
even though electric
construction machinery

00:07:37.756 --> 00:07:41.436
barely existed prior to this project.

00:07:41.476 --> 00:07:45.156
This change has been made
through procurement.

00:07:45.716 --> 00:07:47.756
In 2017,

00:07:47.796 --> 00:07:50.556
the city decided to use procurement

00:07:50.596 --> 00:07:54.756
to drive markets
for developing technologies

00:07:54.756 --> 00:07:56.996
we needed to reach the climate goals.

00:07:57.356 --> 00:07:59.516
Like in every city,

00:07:59.516 --> 00:08:02.436
construction is a big emission source,